---
cuisine: Indian
---

Boil @egg{} for ~{15%minutes}

Dice @onion{1} into quarters and mix in #food processor{}

Pour @sunflower oil{} then boil onion in #pot{} until water has evaporated

Meanwhile make tomato paste	

Add tomato paste, @salt{1%tsp}, @chilli powder{1%tsp}, @cumin powder{1%tsp} and @egg curry masala{}. Mix then add @coconut milk{}